    "content":"<style>body.dark {--bg: #0f0f0f;--card: #1c1c1c;--text: #eee;--sub: #aaa;    }body {background: var(--bg);            color: var(--text);    }        main {            width: 100%;            display: flex;            flex-direction: column;            gap: 20px;    }        .container {            display: grid;            grid-template-columns: auto auto auto;            gap: 20px;    }    /* ==== SECTION ==== */        section {            background: var(--card);            padding: 20px;            border-radius: 12px;            box-shadow: 0 4px 15px rgba(0,        0,        0, .05);    }    /* ==== TEXT ==== */        .paragraph {            text-indent: 2em;            line-height: 1.8;            text-align: justify;            color: var(--sub);    }    /* ==== DETAILS ==== */        details {            background: rgba(0,        0,        0, .03);            border-radius: 10px;            margin: 8px 0;            overflow: hidden;    }        summary {            cursor: pointer;            padding: 10px;            font-weight: 500;    }        details[open    ] summary {            background: var(--accent);            color: #fff;    }    /* ==== LIST ==== */        ol,        ul {            padding-left: 18px;    }        ul.alphabet {            margin-left: 20px;            list-style: lower-alpha;    }    /* ==== TAG ==== */        .tag {            display: inline-block;            background: var(--accent);            color: #fff;            padding: 4px 10px;            border-radius: 20px;            font-size: 12px;            margin-bottom: 10px;    }    /* ==== HOVER ==== */        section:hover {            transform: translateY(-3px);    }        @media (max-width: 600px) {            .container {                display: flex;                flex-direction: column;        }    }    </style>    <main>        <div class=\"hero\">            <h1>Learn Smarter, Not Harder</h1>            <p>Simple strategies to make learning faster, easier, and more effective.</p>        </div>        <div class=\"container\">            <!-- ===== MINDSET ===== -->            <section>                <span class=\"tag\">Mindset</span>                <h2>Make Learning Enjoyable</h2>                <ol>                    <li>                        <details>                            <summary>Learning is a need, not an obligation</summary>                            <p class=\"paragraph\">Shift your mindset from “I have to study” to “I need to study.” This                                small change makes                                learning                                feel natural instead of forced.</p>                        </details>                    </li>                    <li>End your study session with a small reward</li>                    <li>                        <details>                            <summary>Turn learning into a game</summary>                            <p class=\"paragraph\">Set challenges like time limits, target scores, or levels. This makes                                studying more engaging                                and                                less boring.</p>                        </details>                    </li>                    <li>Follow your curiosity and focus on understanding, not memorization.</li>                </ol>            </section>            <!-- ===== TECHNIQUE ===== -->            <section>                <span class=\"tag\">Technique</span>                <h2>Effective Learning Methods</h2>                <ol>                    <li>                        <details>                            <summary>Spaced Repetition</summary>                            <p class=\"paragraph\">Review material over increasing intervals to move it into long-term                                memory.</p>                        </details>                    </li>                    <li>                        <details>                            <summary>Retrieval Practice</summary>                            <p class=\"paragraph\">Don’t just reread—force your brain to recall information without                                looking.</p>                            <ul class=\"alphabet\">                                <li>Read the material</li>                                <li>Close your notes</li>                                <li>Write what you remember</li>                                <li>Check and fix mistakes</li>                            </ul>                        </details>                    </li>                    <li>                        <details>                            <summary>Interleaving</summary>                            <p class=\"paragraph\">Mix different topics in one study session to improve flexibility and                                deeper understanding.                            </p>                        </details>                    </li>                    <li>                        <details>                            <summary>Generation</summary>                            <p class=\"paragraph\">Explain the material in your own words. This strengthens understanding                                much more than passive                                reading.</p>                        </details>                    </li>                </ol>            </section>            <!-- ===== SKILL ===== -->            <section>                <span class=\"tag\">Skill</span>                <h2>Learn Any Skill Faster</h2>                <ol>                    <li>                        <details>                            <summary>Deconstruct</summary>                            <p class=\"paragraph\">Break the skill into smaller subskills to make it easier to learn.</p>                        </details>                    </li>                    <li>                        <details>                            <summary>Learn</summary>                            <p class=\"paragraph\">Focus on mastering each subskill step by step.</p>                        </details>                    </li>                    <li>                        <details>                            <summary>Remove Barriers</summary>                            <p class=\"paragraph\">Eliminate distractions, fear, and anything that slows your progress.                            </p>                        </details>                    </li>                    <li>                        <details>                            <summary>Practice</summary>                            <p class=\"paragraph\">Spend at least 20 focused hours on the most important parts.</p>                        </details>                    </li>                </ol>            </section>            <!-- ===== MISTAKES ===== -->            <section>                <span class=\"tag\">Mistakes</span>                <h2>Common Learning Mistakes</h2>                <ol>                    <li>Skipping the fundamentals.</li>                    <li>Using the wrong learning order.</li>                    <li>Focusing on memorization instead of understanding.</li>                </ol>            </section>            <!-- ===== AI ===== -->            <section>                <span class=\"tag\">AI</span>                <h2>Learning with AI</h2>                <ul>                    <li>Use AI to explain difficult concepts.</li>                    <li>Ask for practice questions.</li>                    <li>Use it as a tutor—not a shortcut.</li>                </ul>            </section>            <section>                <span class=\"tag\">Tips</span>                <h2>Learning Tips</h2>                <ul>                    <li>Find the reason why you want to learn. Make the reason become your motivation when you lazy</li>                </ul>            </section>        </div></main>"
}